    (at 30 220 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d68a2ffd-369e-5fd2-af14-2e2ef34d4721"))
  (text
    "U1 sequencer: program with seq.jed. U2 SIO driver: program with sio.jed."
    (at 30 225.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b629a623-d682-5adf-bf97-2bf7a8d80da8"))
  (text
    "A0-A7 come from the 8052's address latch, A8-A15 from P2, AD0-AD7 are P0."
    (at 30 230.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "021ded91-19ab-5c2b-971e-5ca599a0378f"))
  (text
    "CPUCLK drives the 8052's XTAL1 (XTAL2 open on CMOS parts): remove its crystal."
    (at 30 235.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "573d6281-fa56-5a79-8195-c6e35865b587"))
  (text
    "Use 74AC or 74ACT logic, not HC: the address enable path is timing-critical."
    (at 30 240.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c76daff0-fd1a-55a4-ac3c-163a46db2108"))
  (text
    "The first MOVX after power-up must write 88h to 9998h (EQIO)."
    (at 30 245.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "281da12d-03a1-526c-919c-e2e6a9579620"))
